I am in the supermarket.
I walk to the spice section.
There are many spices here.
It smells very good here.
I want green cardamom.
I like cardamom in my morning tea.
I like strong flavors.
I take a small packet of cardamom.
I also want black pepper.
I look at the packets of black pepper.
There are big packets here.
But, I want a small packet.
I take a small packet of black pepper.
I look at the price of these packets.
The cardamom is eighty rupees.
The black pepper is sixty rupees.
I put these in my basket.
Now, I want lentils.
